{"seq":3,"slug":"computational-geometry","title":"算法与计算几何","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/parametric-algorithmic/computational-geometry","wordCount":1403,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"算法与计算几何\">算法与计算几何</h1><p>当你在 Grasshopper 里拖出一条平滑曲线，屏幕背后发生的是一串多项式求值；当机器人沿着一个曲面铺设打印路径，它读取的是这个曲面的参数化方程。前两篇讲的范式与工具，最终都要落到几何的数学表达上——这是所有计算性设计真正运转的引擎。本篇下沉到这一层，讲清 NURBS、网格、细分曲面这些底层表达，以及计算几何的几个基础算法。这一篇是 <a href=\"intro-and-core-concepts\">计算性设计导论</a> 中「显式建模需要可计算的几何」承诺的兑现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-几何的两种数字表达\">核心概念：几何的两种数字表达</h2><p>数字几何有两条根本不同的表达路线，理解它们的取舍是计算几何的起点。一是参数化表达（如 NURBS），用连续的数学函数描述形状，精确、光滑、分辨率无关，但拓扑操作复杂。二是离散表达（如多边形网格），用大量小平面逼近形状，拓扑灵活、易于渲染与制造，但本质是近似。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[几何对象] --&gt; B[参数化表达 NURBS]&#10;  A --&gt; C[离散表达 网格 Mesh]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[精确光滑]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[分辨率无关]&#10;  B --&gt; B3[拓扑操作难]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[拓扑灵活]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[渲染制造友好]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[本质为近似]&#10;  B1 --&gt; D[建造路径 / 性能分析]&#10;  C1 --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n  A[几何对象] --&gt; B[参数化表达 NURBS]\n  A --&gt; C[离散表达 网格 Mesh]\n  B --&gt; B1[精确光滑]\n  B --&gt; B2[分辨率无关]\n  B --&gt; B3[拓扑操作难]\n  C --&gt; C1[拓扑灵活]\n  C --&gt; C2[渲染制造友好]\n  C --&gt; C3[本质为近似]\n  B1 --&gt; D[建造路径 / 性能分析]\n  C1 --&gt; D</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表达方式</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>拓扑灵活性</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n<th>代表格式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NURBS 曲面</td>\n<td>精确（解析）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>工业设计、自由曲面建筑</td>\n<td>Rhino .3dm、STEP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多边形网格</td>\n<td>近似</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>渲染、有限元、3D 打印</td>\n<td>OBJ、STL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>细分曲面</td>\n<td>可控逼近</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>动画、概念建模</td>\n<td>Catmull–Clark</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"nurbs-自由曲面的数学语言\">NURBS：自由曲面的数学语言</h2><p>NURBS（非均匀有理 B 样条）是当代自由曲面建筑的通用语言。它用控制点、权重和节点向量定义一条曲线或一张曲面。一条 NURBS 曲线的数学定义是控制点的加权混合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C(u) = \\frac{\\sum_{i=0}^{n} N_{i,p}(u)\\, w_i\\, P_i}{\\sum_{i=0}^{n} N_{i,p}(u)\\, w_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.488em;vertical-align:-0.994em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.494em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3057em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.994em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是控制点，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是权重，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{i,p}(u)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 次 B 样条基函数。关键洞察是：设计师拖动控制点，曲线随之平滑变形，但曲线本身并不穿过大多数控制点——控制点像磁铁一样「吸引」曲线。这种「局部控制」特性正是它好用的原因：移动一个控制点只影响附近一段曲线，不会牵动全局。</p>\n<p>权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的引入（NURBS 中的「有理」）让它能精确表达圆、椭圆等二次曲线，这是普通 B 样条做不到的。正因如此，NURBS 成为 Rhino、Alias 等工业级建模软件的核心，也是扎哈式自由曲面建筑能精确建造的数学保障。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网格与细分-离散世界的几何\">网格与细分：离散世界的几何</h2><p>当几何要被渲染、做有限元分析或送进 3D 打印机，就必须离散化为网格。网格由顶点、边、面构成，最常见的是三角网格。它的优势是任何拓扑都能表达，且所有下游计算（光照、碰撞、切片）都建立在简单的三角形上。</p>\n<p>网格的质量直接决定建造质量。面向 <a href=\"../digital-fabrication/additive-3d-printing\">增材制造与3D打印</a> 的 STL 文件本质就是三角网格，网格过粗会让曲面呈现可见的多边形棱角，过细则文件臃肿、切片缓慢——这是一个典型的精度与效率权衡。</p>\n<p>细分曲面（subdivision surface）架起了两个世界的桥梁。Catmull–Clark 等算法从一个粗糙的控制网格出发，反复细分、平滑，逼近一张光滑曲面。它兼具网格的拓扑灵活与近似的光滑性，是概念建模阶段的利器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计算几何的基础算法\">计算几何的基础算法</h2><p>支撑这一切的是一组计算几何的经典算法，它们在参数化工具内部默默运转。</p>\n<p>凸包（convex hull）求一组点的最小包围凸多边形，是碰撞检测、形态分析的基础。Voronoi 图把平面按「离哪个种子点最近」划分成多边形区域，在建筑中被广泛用于生成有机的细分肌理与立面图案。与之对偶的 Delaunay 三角剖分则给出「最饱满」的三角网格，是地形建模和有限元网格生成的标准方法。</p>\n<p>布尔运算（并、交、差）处理实体的组合，是建模操作的基石，但在 NURBS 上实现稳健的布尔运算极其困难——这也是为什么复杂布尔常退化到网格上完成。这些算法的复杂度直接影响交互体验：Delaunay 三角剖分可在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 时间完成，而朴素的最近点查询是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，借助 k-d 树等空间索引可降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，这正是大模型仍能流畅交互的关键。</p>\n<p>这些几何与算法构成的数据，最终会进入 <a href=\"../bim-digital-workflow/bim-information-model\">BIM原理与信息模型</a> 成为带属性的构件，或直接驱动 <a href=\"../digital-fabrication/robotic-cnc-fabrication\">机器人建造与数控加工</a> 的加工路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>数字几何有两条路线：NURBS 等参数化表达（精确光滑、分辨率无关、拓扑难）与网格等离散表达（拓扑灵活、制造友好、本质近似）。</li>\n<li>NURBS 用控制点加权混合定义曲线曲面，靠局部控制与有理权重精确表达圆等曲线，是自由曲面建筑的数学语言。</li>\n<li>网格是渲染、分析与 3D 打印的通用离散表达，网格质量决定建造质量；细分曲面在拓扑灵活与光滑之间架桥。</li>\n<li>凸包、Voronoi、Delaunay、布尔运算等计算几何算法在工具内部运转，空间索引把查询复杂度从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>几何数据下游进入 <a href=\"../bim-digital-workflow/bim-information-model\">BIM原理与信息模型</a>、<a href=\"../digital-fabrication/additive-3d-printing\">增材制造与3D打印</a> 与 <a href=\"../digital-fabrication/robotic-cnc-fabrication\">机器人建造与数控加工</a>。</li>\n<li>本篇是 <a href=\"intro-and-core-concepts\">计算性设计导论</a> 与 <a href=\"parametric-generative-design\">参数化建模与生成式设计</a> 的数学底座。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"算法与计算几何","id":"算法与计算几何"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：几何的两种数字表达","id":"核心概念-几何的两种数字表达"},{"level":2,"text":"NURBS：自由曲面的数学语言","id":"nurbs-自由曲面的数学语言"},{"level":2,"text":"网格与细分：离散世界的几何","id":"网格与细分-离散世界的几何"},{"level":2,"text":"计算几何的基础算法","id":"计算几何的基础算法"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"参数化建模与生成式设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/parametric-algorithmic/parametric-generative-design"},"next":{"title":"BIM 原理与信息模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/computational-design-digital-fabrication/bim-digital-workflow/bim-information-model"}}